4EB3 AllocateNextFreePhrase ; scan phrase-alloc bitmap ($3E82) from current phrase, mark first free; full -> ShowOutOfMemory, ret $ff
5253 CopyInstrument     ; copy the instrument ("COPIED INSTR"): wClipboardType=6, 16 instr bytes -> screen scratch
546E CloneInstrumentTable    ; on instr TABLE field: alloc table copy (bank1f), "CLONED TABLE", write #|$20
5503 PasteInstrument    ; if select-held + clipboardType==6: paste 16 bytes back into instrument
74F7 DrawMessageBar     ; render wStringBuffer (20 ch) to tilemap row 0 + CGB attrs (MessageBarAttributeRow)
7616 ShowTapAddPhrase   ; push TxtTapAddPhrase, call ShowMessage
7635 ShowMax16Marks     ; push TxtMax16Marks, call ShowMessage
781F ClearMessageBar    ; zero wMessageStringPointer, fill top bar with spaces
